%
% AC-1: a counterfactual query yields the expected consequent.
% Base: status(server, up). Antecedent overwrites the functional slot to
% status(server, down); the rule then fires alert(server, fired) inside W_cf.
:- prefix(ex, 'https://example.org/worlds-c/revision/').
:- counterfactual(ex:cf, ex:base).
:- assume(ex:status(ex:server, ex:down)).
ex:alert(X, ex:fired) :- ex:status(X, ex:down).
?- ex:alert(ex:server, Z).
